# Read by Docker from the build-context root, which is THIS directory: compose
# and the workflows build with context ./app.  A previous copy lived at the
# repository root, where nothing read it, and excluded nothing.
#
# What is in the shipped image is decided by the explicit COPY allowlist in the
# Dockerfile, not here.  This file keeps junk and secrets out of the build
# context itself, so they cannot land in a layer by accident (T-27).
.env
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.venv/
venv/

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
